{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7f408aabba5d0b2e","name":"Jedi Watchman Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7f408aabba5d0b2e","title":"Jedi Watchman Talent Tree","revision":26664,"timestamp":"2025-05-28T19:10:19Z","sha256":"703b9ba083206ad712ce0362956e0b2b16cd60010342fcc29f243fbab78b16f5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26664","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Watchman%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7f408aabba5d0b2e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Jedi Watchmen are elite Jedi tasked with protecting and watching over a specific world or region of space. They seek out and destroy threats to the Republic and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". As such, they have enhanced their abilities to blend in and covertly investigate threats at their source. All Jedi Watchmen are appointed and approved by the Jedi Council before training; many begin as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Consulars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Consular_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:2d5d4eaa526628c0"},". A Jedi Watchman's assignments might change, as directed by the council.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Warning"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Allies within 12 squares can choose to reroll their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," checks at the start of combat, but must keep the result of the reroll, even if it is worse. Furthermore, if any allies within 12 squares are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"}," at the start of an encounter, but you are not, you can designate a number of those allies equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," modifier (minimum 1); those allies are no longer considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", and can act normally during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Quick Draw (Lightsabers)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quick Draw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quick_Draw","referenceId":"reference:ad3a4bd9344ce557"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Lightsabers)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Lightsabers)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are carrying a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," (either in your hand or at your belt), you can draw the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", ignite it, and make a single attack during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", even if you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},". If you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", you can take any single Action of your choice, as normal. Additionally, once per turn you may draw and ignite a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," on your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sheltering Stance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Vigilance"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are adjacent to an ally, you may use the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," Talents on attacks that target that ally without the need to spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vigilance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," you may designate one adjacent ally as the target of this Talent. That target gains a +1 deflection bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," as long as you remain adjacent to them. You may change the target of this Talent as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Watchman's Advance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Warning"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When acting in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", you and your allies can take an extra ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Any character can gain only one extra ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", regardless of the number of characters with this Talent in your group.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
